# The Schnitzl surprise on sir_schnitzl's channel: exactly one of five spawn rewards comes twice.
# Profile LocalLow/Just2D/Drova/Sprint_24_A (a copy of Sprint_24). Override the save with -D hero=N -D slot=N.

default hero 5
default slot 0

launch A
A wait ready=1 timeout=240
A wait saves=separate timeout=1
A load $hero $slot
A wait world=1 timeout=240

A twitch_monster 505832a81f5f1b24c85fa1e924bb3401
A expect twitch_reward Monster contains True timeout=1
A expect twitch_surprises == 0 timeout=1

A twitch_channel Sir_Schnitzl
A expect twitch_reward Monster contains True timeout=1
A expect twitch_reward Monster contains True timeout=1
A expect twitch_reward Monster contains True timeout=1
A expect twitch_reward Monster contains True timeout=1
A expect twitch_reward Monster contains True timeout=1
A expect twitch_surprises == 1 timeout=1
A ?actors 600
